SUMMARY:Fogo World "Caip" Cup Watch Parties
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T203000
UID:366779e77d9125c97352ea039a743441@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Brazil game days and experience every match the Fog
 o way with handcrafted Caipirinha flavors\, passed Bar Bites\, and fire-ro
 asted favorites. Sip on Traditional\, Strawberry Hibiscus\, Mango Habanero
 \, Passion Fruit\, or our limited-time World Caip\, crafted with your choi
 ce of silver or gold cachaça\, or enjoy our refreshing Watermelon Copa Co
 oler mocktail. Enjoy these flavors alongside our fire-roasted cuts\, inclu
 ding Picanha\, Fraldinha\, and more. It’s a celebration you won’t want
  to miss. INCLUDES PREMIUM FIRE-ROASTED CUT TASTINGS\, TWO PREMIUM COCKTAI
 LS & PASSED BAR BITES $54 per person*
